<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>x500_delivery</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>
  <description>
    Stock PX4 x500 quadrotor plus the delivery sensor suite: a 320x240 downward
    camera for ArUco pad detection and a 360-degree 2D LiDAR for reactive
    obstacle avoidance.

    Vendored into DroneProgram (remediation plan P0.2 / finding F2) because the
    sensors previously lived as an uncommitted edit inside the
    PX4-Autopilot/Tools/simulation/gz git submodule, where any
    `git submodule update --force`, rebase, or fresh clone would silently
    delete them and leave the drone flying blind.

    Neither sensor declares a &lt;topic&gt;, so Gazebo derives a model-scoped
    topic name per spawned instance (finding F7). See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
  </description>
</model>
